<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Applied Digital raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Applied Digital raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Soundview Financial said analyst Chandan Sarkar raised his long-term rating on Applied Digital Access Inc to buy from hold, and kept the short-term rating at hold.</p>
<p>-- kept his estimates at loss $0.47 per share for 1996, and loss $0.10 for 1997.</p>
<p>-- shares gained 3/4 to 7-3/8.</p>
</text>
